msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>600<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Restores 7% of maximum MP<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Addersgall Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>1"
