msgid "Reduces damage taken by self and nearby party members by 10%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s<br>Effect cannot be stacked with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Taurochole</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><if ($gn68 == 40)><if ($gn72 >= 78)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Regen</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>100<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s<br></if></if><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Restores 7% of maximum MP<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Addersgall Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>1"
